# HTTP Requests for Testing 2FA Workflow

### 1. Login to get authentication token
POST http://localhost:8080/oldtech/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "luonghau2909@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456789"
}

### 2. Setup 2FA (copy the token from the previous response)

POST http://localhost:8080/oldtech/auth/2fa/setup
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJsdW9uZ2hhdTI5MDlAZ21haWwuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNzQ5MzIwNTQyLCJleHAiOjE3NTE5MTI1NDJ9.88uOllx3kVrA_qQl3uRU0i5WH3kc478UXyE4bxzaspbj7TgWMantflJ-hW2QTC47TxH1ko_X4KMY1-cX8qJp4w
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Verify 2FA code (Enter code from Google Authenticator app)
POST http://localhost:8080/oldtech/auth/2fa/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "luonghau2909@gmail.com",
  "code": "123456"  // Replace with actual code from Google Authenticator
}

### 4. Check 2FA status for user
GET http://localhost:8080/oldtech/auth/2fa/status?email=luonghau2909@gmail.com
